This package currently contains CarbonEngineJS original project code only. It
implements CEWGPU descriptor normalization plus live WebGPU pipeline, resource,
binding, and draw realization, together with Carbon-style effect path
rewriting. CarbonEngine and Fenris Creations (CCP Games) are mentioned for
interoperability, provenance, and behavioral reference context only. This
package is not affiliated with or endorsed by CCP Games.

Development tooling
-------------------

The optional WebGPU verification harness uses Microsoft Playwright as a
development dependency to launch a browser. Playwright is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. It is not a runtime dependency and no Playwright source is
copied into this package.

